# Production environment variables for the frontend.
#
# These are build-time values baked into the client bundle by Vite, so they are
# public by definition — anyone can read them in the shipped JavaScript. Only
# values that are safe to publish belong here.
#
# The Supabase anon key is one of those: it identifies the project, carries no
# privileges of its own, and is gated by row-level security. It must be
# committed (or set as a Vercel environment variable) or the production build
# has no Supabase config and the app fails to mount.
#
# Secrets — the Featherless API key, any Supabase service_role key — are
# server-side only and live in backend/.env, which is gitignored.

VITE_API_URL=https://kneeai.vercel.app/api
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://kgevtvmqcxzfwiqprciu.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImtnZXZ0dm1xY3h6ZndpcXByY2l1Iiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODczOTczOTUsImV4cCI6MjEwMjk3MzM5NX0.bZXfitTtnf_ppWxI1ZnqKaU1aZKOVV6Cd_HtHQkdEJM
